riginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=GUt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdac24c2-a145-4c77-9dc4-f9adbfface4a","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"個人的にコンフリクトの解消ミスに対しては、\nrange-diff を覚えてから rebase の方がいいなと思うようになりました。\n\nrange-diff ならコミット単位でミスを見つけて直せるので。\nmerge は merge でコンフリクトした箇所を（combined diff で）すぐ見つけられるのがよいのですが。","ts":"1626152748.064300","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1626152814.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BDbh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c0af0ba-ab01-4182-b946-20e4ea2f42c3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ぼくは基本rebaseだけど、何かあったとき(コンフリクトで修正ミスったり）に戻せるように最近mergeが多め","ts":"1626152505.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oF9zn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e825a4a-1f45-41a7-8ee4-dc25b2393385","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"確かにコンフリクトでぐちゃぐちゃになるのがわかったらマージしますね\n\n```分岐元のコミット大して進んでないしコンフリクトしても対応できるな\n→ rebase```\n```分岐元のコミット結構進んだけど修正じゃなくて新規ファイルしかないし\n→ rebase```\n```分岐元のコミット結構進んだけどワンチャンいけるのでは\n→ rebase\n→ 対応できないと感じたらmergeに切り替える```\n```どう考えてもコンフリクトしか起こさない自信がある\n→ merge```\nこんな心持ちでやっていこうと思います","ts":"1626152136.060300","thread_ts":"1626151671.052500","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mn=C"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"D4D25330-A456-465D-89B7-A3E931E3449A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あ、でもコンフリクトが発生していて、マージ後に何か問題が発生しそうな気配がするときはマージコミットします。その方が取り消しが楽なんで。","ts":"1626151671.052500","thread_ts":"1626151671.052500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bHJ1"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"2b4e833c-040a-4346-99a2-4670ffb22583","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"私も基本 rebase 派ですが、最近 GitHub まともに触るようになって\n\u0026gt; ただしまだ未完成で他の人の意見を聞きながら修正をしたい\nWIP のソースにコメントもらった後「これ rebase していいの？」って迷います。","ts":"1626152072.059700","thread_ts":"1626152072.059700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GMhuL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37a268a6-c036-4993-90fa-c5185d10577e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"開発ブランチならrebaseしちゃう","ts":"1626152065.059500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ubhf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60d8dae2-d080-4e81-ba20-3f472af2dd49","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"社では merge してますね","ts":"1626152013.057600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DqI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ac428bf-9929-41b5-8809-85dc28250daa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は rebase 派","ts":"1626151867.054100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5dFA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D4D25330-A456-465D-89B7-A3E931E3449A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あ、でもコンフリクトが発生していて、マージ後に何か問題が発生しそうな気配がするときはマージコミットします。その方が取り消しが楽なんで。","ts":"1626151671.052500","thread_ts":"1626151671.052500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bHJ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D16B5B11-5589-44BB-AD56-F0E05D44FA2E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"WIPであれば僕はrebaseしてますね","ts":"1626151570.049800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7MTB3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e88f7c68-1bf4-4550-8264-9d7eb4bace8d","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"WIPが外れたあとの処理は普通にマージしようと思ってました\nやるとしたらコミットの整理かな","ts":"1626151516.049100","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1626151617.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J/t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a3fa8ea-6580-4a3b-8bb3-0e4d99f00d7b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そのWIPが、\n• あとでコミット整理するのか\n• マージはsquash mergeなのか\nによる気がする\nあと他の人がコミットしないならrebaseでいいかなという気もしますが","ts":"1626151122.047700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gLc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b92e4690-6d56-4f52-a8e3-486bedab180a","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"分岐元のブランチの更新を取り込む場合のコマンドについて質問です\n\n次のようなユースケースを考えます\n```・developブランチからfeature/hogeを切る\n・feature/hogeからdevelopに向けてプルリクを立てる。ただしまだ未完成で他の人の意見を聞きながら修正をしたいのでWIPにしてマージできないようにする\n・その間にもdevelopは進んでいるので途中でdevelopの更新を取り込む必要がある\n* 他の人はfeature/hogeをpullして中身を見ることはあってもコミットすることはないものとする```\n→ このときにどんなコマンドを使って更新するかに悩まされています\n\n候補\n`pull --rebase` : プッシュしちゃったし大丈夫かな?\n`fetch origin \u0026amp;\u0026amp; merge origin/dedelop` : 確実だが余計なマージコミットできるしコミットグラフも見にくくなるなー","ts":"1626151022.046600","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1626151658.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dmaz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b26dcc24-1d09-4d3d-9602-a644b594acb9","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"触ってみた感じ、細かい違いがあって辛かったです。gh repo listに対応するものがないとか、listの長さを指定する引数が違うとか……。","ts":"1626109449.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qp8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23DC8BAE-2C9D-495A-BBFB-C7C1173FFF2D","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"`hub` に対して `lab` (\u003chttps://zaquestion.github.io/lab|https://zaquestion.github.io/lab\u003e)で、\n`gh` に対しては `glab` か\nghを使うようにしたからGitLabの方もglabに移行しようかな…","ts":"1626108873.036600","attachments":[{"fallback":"lab","id":1,"title":"lab","title_link":"https://zaquestion.github.io/lab","text":"Lab wraps Git or Hub, making it simple to clone, fork, and interact with repositories on GitLab","blocks":null,"service_name":"zaquestion.github.io","from_url":"https://zaquestion.github.io/lab","original_url":"https://zaquestion.github.io/lab"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hai"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d1ccc4b-f6c1-4ffa-ad86-514aa2807eec","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"シェルスクリプト複雑な事をしようとすると急につらくなる","ts":"1626107653.033500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ivn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aa845fc-7a79-4dcb-aeed-7ee4d07341af","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"GitHub CLIのghに対してGitLab CLIのglabがサードパーティによって開発されているみたいなので、`glabf`としてgh-fzfに追加してみました。思ったより大変でした……。慣れの問題もあるでしょうが、そらみんなdenoとかgoとかでコマンド作りたくなるわなあと思いました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/atusy/gh-fzf\u003e","ts":"1626107415.032300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"atusy/gh-fzf","id":1,"title":"atusy/gh-fzf","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"1","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Shell","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0j5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"069bee2a-2554-40d5-a742-2f6d9e66755e","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; `@{u}`\nトラッキング中のリポジトリであることが前提ですが","ts":"1626154576.067300","thread_ts":"1626154462.067200","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W1p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eb8f3fb-557c-4d8b-8fd4-377481322bcf","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"確かに、コミットは別物になるからそれってどうなるんだろう","ts":"1626152346.060600","thread_ts":"1626152072.059700","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"